WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.352
Legend has it that when Sima Guang was little, he played with his little friends in the courtyard.

00:00:05.702 --> 00:00:10.694
Laughter filled the courtyard, and the children were having a wonderful time.

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:16.084
One child climbed onto the big water vat and, in a moment of carelessness, fell in.

00:00:16.434 --> 00:00:20.034
The vat was tall and big, and it was filled with water.

00:00:20.384 --> 00:00:25.544
The other children were terrified and hurried off to call the adults for help.

00:00:25.894 --> 00:00:29.758
Everyone was frantic with worry, not knowing what to do.

00:00:30.108 --> 00:00:35.364
Only seven-year-old Sima Guang picked up a big stone instead.

00:00:35.714 --> 00:00:38.901
He thought calmly for a moment, and his eyes suddenly lit up.

00:00:39.251 --> 00:00:44.507
He smashed the vat with all his strength; the water flowed out, and the child was saved.

00:00:44.857 --> 00:00:50.113
With a loud bang, a big crack split open in the vat.

00:00:50.463 --> 00:00:56.511
The story of 'Sima Guang Smashes the Vat' became a beloved tale of quick thinking, passed down through the ages.

00:00:56.861 --> 00:01:01.205
The adults hurried over at the sound and all praised him for being clever and brave.

